      "en": "He raises up the poor out of the dust, and lifts up the needy from the ash heap,",
      "ko": "가난한 자를 진토에서 일으키시며 궁핍한 자를 거름 무더기에서 드셔서",
      "source_text_hash": "033d32cdb4ef7059d0d29cf6819a5aac41a38bfd3b0a14ceebffdaacc30dedb8",
      "translation_text_hash": "44323b744e53f36b9ffc92c853a058c7c97b1463c5396e46ed9183b8654162a7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
